<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "Liberation Serif", "DejaVu Serif", Georgia, serif; }
  h1, h2 { font-weight: bold; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  td { padding: 5px 0; }
  .signature-line { border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-top: 50px; margin-bottom: 50px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: left;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">Wilkes University</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 0;">International Student Sponsorship Affidavit Form</h2>

    <p style="margin-top: 20px;">Return this form to:</p>
    <p>Mailing Address: <span data-field="mailing_address_line_1">{{ mailing_address_line_1 }}</span>, <span data-field="mailing_address_city">{{ mailing_address_city }}</span>, <span data-field="mailing_address_state">{{ mailing_address_state }}</span> <span data-field="mailing_address_zip">{{ mailing_address_zip }}</span>.</p>
    <p>Fax: <span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span> Email: <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span></p>

    <p style="margin-top: 20px;">All international students who will require an F or J student visa must complete the statement below. Wilkes University requires documentation certifying the validity of the financial resources listed on this sheet. In addition to this affidavit, students must show proof of finances for the first year of intended study. This evidence should consist of:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>An official bank statement on original letterhead stationery and dated within the last three months that proves sufficient funds are available or;</li>
      <li>A statement of support from a sponsor, along with evidence of the sponsor's financial resources in the form of an official bank statement, or</li>
      <li>An official letter of award from your government or other sponsoring organization indicating the terms of the support.</li>
    </ul>
    <p style="margin-top: 20px;">All documentation must be current. Solvency certificates, salary statements, chartered accountant statements, lines of credit and brokerage account statements are not accepted.</p>

    <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">Estimated Cost – Academic Year (August – May)</h3>
    <p>THE ESTIMATED ANNUAL COST FOR THE <span data-field="academic_year">{{ academic_year }}</span> ACADEMIC YEAR IS AS FOLLOWS:</p>

    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <td style="width: 30%;">Undergraduate</td>
          <td style="width: 30%;">Graduate</td>
          <td style="width: 20%;">Tuition & Fees</td>
          <td style="width: 20%;">Room & Board</td>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Tuition & Fees</td>
          <td><span data-field="cost.undergraduate_tuition">{{ cost.undergraduate_tuition }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="cost.graduate_tuition">{{ cost.graduate_tuition }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="cost.undergraduate_room_board">{{ cost.undergraduate_room_board }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="cost.graduate_room_board">{{ cost.graduate_room_board }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Room & Board</td>
          <td><span data-field="cost.undergraduate_room_board_2">{{ cost.undergraduate_room_board_2 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="cost.graduate_room_board_2">{{ cost.graduate_room_board_2 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="cost.undergraduate_misc">{{ cost.undergraduate_misc }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="cost.graduate_misc">{{ cost.graduate_misc }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Miscellaneous</td>
          <td><span data-field="cost.undergraduate_misc_2">{{ cost.undergraduate_misc_2 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="cost.graduate_misc_2">{{ cost.graduate_misc_2 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="cost.undergraduate_total">{{ cost.undergraduate_total }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="cost.graduate_total">{{ cost.graduate_total }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Total</td>
          <td><span data-field="total_undergraduate">{{ total_undergraduate }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="total_graduate">{{ total_graduate }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="total_tuition">{{ total_tuition }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="total_room_board">{{ total_room_board }}</span></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <p>The above examples are for planning purposes only. Official bills for tuition and fees will be presented at registration. Some courses require additional fees. Wilkes University reserves the right to change any of the above expenses without prior notification.</p>

    <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">Sponsor Certification</h3>

    <p>Name of Sponsor: _________________________ (In English and native alphabet if not Latin)</p>
    <p>Name of Student: _________________________</p>
    <p>Relationship to Student: _________________________</p>

    <p style="margin-top: 20px;">I, _________________________ (sponsor's name), promise that I can and will _________________________ (student's name) financial support of no less than <span data-field="amount_promised">{{ amount_promised }}</span> for tuition, housing, and other expenses every year while he/she studies at Wilkes University.</p>

    <p style="margin-top: 40px;">Attached, please find the following documents as evidence of my financial capability to keep my promise:</p>

    <p style="margin-top: 50px;">I swear that the information I have provided above is true and correct.</p>

    <table style="width: 100%; margin-top: 80px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 50%; vertical-align: top;">Signature of Sponsor</td>
        <td style="width: 50%; text-align: right; vertical-align: top;">Today's Date</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</div>